@ApiService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5379

GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Scalar's password-grant adapter (use a development account)
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username={{username}}&password={{password}}

### Refresh and rotate tokens (use the latest refresh_token from the response)
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&refresh_token={{refreshToken}}

### Unsupported grants return an OAuth error
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials